desc:Hypnomix Probe (measures this track for the HypnoMix app; audio passes through)
//tags: analysis meter hypnomix
//author: hypnomix
// Put it LAST on a track: it hears the track after all its plug-ins. Ten times a second it measures the 20 values
// the hypnomix app reads (the same as its Live probe): K-weighted RMS, sample peak and RMS per channel, mid, side and
// L*R, the same below 120 Hz, and 8 bands of the mid signal. The hypnomix bridge (`hypnomix reaper start`) reads them
// from shared memory and passes them to the app. Tell it what the track is with the menus.
options:gmem=hypnomix

slider1:role=0<0,19,1{auto,lead vocal,harmony,double,backing vocals,kick,snare,drums,percussion,bass,guitar,acoustic guitar,piano,keys,synth,strings,pad,brass,fx,other}>What it is
slider2:priority=0<0,2,1{normal,focus: others give way,background: gives way}>Priority
slider3:protect=0<0,1,1{off,on: ask before any change}>Protect
slider4:slot=-1<-1,4095,1>-slot (set by hypnomix)

import hypnomix_meter.jsfx-inc

in_pin:left input
in_pin:right input
out_pin:left output
out_pin:right output

